      "title": "quake: register for the default Hexen II port",
      "message": "quake: register for the default Hexen II port\n\nHexen II, being based on the Quake engine, uses the same protocol.\n\nThe `DEFAULTnet_hostport` macro has different values in Quake and Hexen II,\nso to avoid confusion, I just removed it and inlined the values instead.\n",
